{"name":"Glitch","hex":"#2c5463","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"glitch","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A problem affecting function.","An unexpected behavior in an electrical signal, especially if the signal spontaneously returns to expected behavior after a period of time."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To experience an unexpected, typically intermittent malfunction.","To perform an exploit or recreate a bug while playing a video game."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/glitch"}],"entries":[{"title":"Glitch","blocks":[{"text":"A glitch is a brief technical fault, such as a transient one that corrects itself, making it difficult to troubleshoot. The term is particularly common in the computing and electronics industries, in circuit bending, as well as among players of video games, although any purposely organized structure, such as speech, may experience glitches."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Glitch_Train_Station_Display.jpg/330px-Glitch_Train_Station_Display.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Glitch","wikidata":"Q543281"},{"title":"Glitch (Australian TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Glitch is an Australian supernatural drama television series developed by Tony Ayres and Louise Fox. Set in the fictional country town of Yoorana, Victoria, it follows seven people who return from the dead in perfect health but with no memory. No one in the town knows why the deceased have returned. Glitch premiered on 9 July 2015 on ABC and the first series was awarded Best Television Drama Series at the 2016 AACTA Awards. The series also won Most Outstanding Drama Series at the 2016 Logie Awards."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/b6/Glitch_%28title_screen%29.jpg/330px-Glitch_%28title_screen%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Glitch_(Australian_TV_series)","wikidata":"Q18702174"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/Virtual_Boy_glitch_in_right_eyepiece.jpg/500px-Virtual_Boy_glitch_in_right_eyepiece.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/Virtual_Boy_glitch_in_right_eyepiece.jpg/1280px-Virtual_Boy_glitch_in_right_eyepiece.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/Virtual_Boy_glitch_in_right_eyepiece.jpg/500px-Virtual_Boy_glitch_in_right_eyepiece.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The start-up screen of the Virtual Boy is affected by a visual glitch.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AVirtual_Boy_glitch_in_right_eyepiece.jpg"}],"sounds":{"glitch":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/37/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-glitch.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/37/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-glitch.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-glitch.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/37/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-glitch.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-glitch.wav.ogg"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Common Teal (Anas crecca) (22239820169)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Common_Teal_%28Anas_crecca%29_%2822239820169%29.jpg/500px-Common_Teal_%28Anas_crecca%29_%2822239820169%29.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Common_Teal_(Anas_crecca)_(22239820169).jpg","share":0.27},{"title":"Teal Blue Abstract Magical Fabric Colorful Background 10","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb